p('Permission, lift, draw',[[d('bk-23-04','Attendants bring bow on wheeled chest; permission','Vishwamitra','वत्स राम, यह धनुष देखो।','Rama, my child, look at this bow.'),f('bk-23-04','Rama approaches and lifts it')],[f('bk-23-05','Rama strings and draws; close action before the break')]],'Two rows slow down the physical action before a page-turn payoff.','The next page is the snap and the assembly’s reaction.','gentle','Keep all bow limbs, hands and wheeled chest context; no cropped half-bow used as proof of action.')
