p('The two bows and the challenge',[[d('bk-27-03','Parashurama distinguishes Shiva’s broken bow and Vishnu’s intact bow','Parashurama','मिथिला में तुमने शिव का धनुष तोड़ा। यह विष्णु का धनुष है।','At Mithila you broke Shiva’s bow. This is Vishnu’s bow.')],[f('bk-27-03','Detail: the intact Vaishnava bow; preserve its distinct history'),d('bk-27-04','Dasharatha pleads for his sons','Dasharatha','मेरे पुत्रों को अभय दीजिए।','Please grant my sons safety.')],[d('bk-27-05','Parashurama offers the bow and asks proof before a duel','Parashurama','इस धनुष पर बाण चढ़ाकर अपना बल दिखाओ।','Fit an arrow to this bow and show your strength.')]],'Approved preview anatomy: wide challenge, paired detail/plea, wide test.','Rama answers respectfully and accepts the bow.','natural','Keep the two-bow history in one short source-checked teller strip; do not recreate the broken Shiva bow as the intact one.')
