p('The choice and the answer',[[d('bk-28-03','Rama explains why he will not harm Parashurama','Rama','आप ब्राह्मण हैं, विश्वामित्र के सम्बन्धी। मैं आपको हानि नहीं पहुँचाऊँगा।','You are a Brahmin and Vishwamitra’s relative. I will not harm you.')],[d('bk-28-03','Rama offers the two possible targets','Rama','बाण का लक्ष्य—आपकी तीव्र गति या तप से अर्जित लोक?','Shall I target your swift movement or the worlds earned through austerity?')],[d('bk-28-03','Parashurama chooses the earned worlds','Parashurama','मेरे अर्जित लोकों को लक्ष्य बनाओ।','Let the worlds I have earned be your target.')]],'Three full-width dialogue rows give the condition and consent their own beats.','Only after the answer does Rama release the arrow.','natural','Use the approved sample as pacing reference; verify the precise meaning of movement/worlds against both publication sources before final lettering.')
