speak('bk-19-01','hospitality is made','Vashishtha','आपकी सेना सहित सबके भोजन की व्यवस्था होगी।','Food will be provided for you and your whole army.')
speak('bk-19-02','king offers wealth','King Vishwamitra','शबला के बदले मेरा धन स्वीकार कीजिए।','Accept my wealth in exchange for Shabala.')
